ootstrap-Based Improvements for Inference with Clustered Errors abstract True\nWhite1982 Maximum Likelihood Estimation of Misspecified Models abstract False\nKoh2017 Understanding Black-box Predictions via Influence Functions abstract True\nBroderick2020 An Automatic Finite-Sample Robustness Metric: When Can Dropping a Little Data Make a Big Difference? abstract True\nChiang2024 Chatbot Arena: An Open Platform for Evaluating LLMs by Human Preference abstract True\nJiang2011 Statistical ranking and combinatorial Hodge theory abstract True\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
